    "updated_at": "2025-09-12T10:16:12Z",
    "body": "Should we annotate the document in some way and make image/media fetching forward that when the URL matches the document URL?\n\nIn particular for non-image media there might be subsequent range requests so we can't necessarily forward the data from the initial fetch (which might overall be harder to specify too).",
